Info manual
***********

The Info version of this README (‘youtube-gt.info’) and its ‘dir’ entry
live at the package root, following the multi-file ELPA convention.
‘package.el’ adds the package's directory to ‘Info-directory-list’
automatically on activation.

   For installs that bypass ‘package.el’ (raw ‘:load-path’, git
submodule, straight.el without info handling), point Info at the package
directory once:

     (with-eval-after-load 'info
       (info-initialize)
       (add-to-list 'Info-directory-list
                    (file-name-directory (locate-library "youtube-gt"))))


